   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h3> Measurement specialist »gemini« </h3> <h1> Easy measurement of crankshaft milling cutters and turning/ broaching tools </h1>",
   "body": "<p><strong>Setting crankshaft milling cutters and turning/reaming tools quickly, conveniently and accurately - no problem with the »gemini« presetting and measuring machine. »gemini« measures 120 cutting edges in just 80 seconds - with unrivaled ease.</strong></p> <p>The unique, fully automatic measurement in »focus 360i« measuring mode is a highlight of the proven ZOLLER image processing »pilot 3.0« - and the high-precision measuring probe for axial run-out compensation makes complex measuring equipment superfluous. You benefit from the highest quality of your workpieces, increased productivity and complete documentation. And you get an ergonomic workstation where the tools can be easily set and automatically measured and checked.</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/en_DE/company/contact\">Inquire now</a></p>",
